+;; The owner's bulk conversion: update_block on an old fenced text block, title unchanged, converts
+;; it; sending the converted block's title again leaves it code. Before the fix:
+;;   expected: (= (as-typed :code "print(1)" "python") ...)  actual: {:type nil :title "```python\nprint(1)\n```"}
